{"id":"n41863-2-7","stage":5,"title":"내딛다 · 步入","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41863-2-7-1","ko":"너 취직했다면서?","zh":"你不是说找到工作了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"취직했다면서?","meaning":"就业，就职","explanation":"취직하다：就业，就职；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"취직하다","audio":"/audio/ae0d20f8151f9c6d1681.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78999","senseId":"1","lemma":"취직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ae0d20f8151f9c6d","term":"취직하다","zh":"就业，就职","audio":"/audio/ae0d20f8151f9c6d1681.mp3","entryId":"78999","definition":"找到一份工作而去单位上班。","pronunciation":["취ː지카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c24169a2dc8677de6190.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41863-2-7-2","ko":"응. 내일이 첫 출근이야. 나도 드디어 사회에 첫발을 내딛는구나.","zh":"对啊。明天就是我第一次上班。我终于也要踏入社会了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일이","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출근이야.","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근：上班；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"출근","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72139","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사회에","meaning":"社会","explanation":"사회：社会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사회","audio":"/audio/550a40b940e2e59e11c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62378","senseId":"2","lemma":"사회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫발을","meaning":"第一步，起步，伊始","explanation":"첫발：第一步，起步，伊始；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"첫발","audio":"/audio/b0f4a041f1780d8f030b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77620","senseId":"2","lemma":"첫발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내딛는구나.","meaning":"步入","explanation":"내딛다：步入；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내딛다","audio":"/audio/40bc7108e70fe665c9cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41863","senseId":"2","lemma":"내딛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"9195c91a6f506a7d","term":"첫","zh":"首次，初次，第一次","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3","entryId":"77610","definition":"最初的。","pronunciation":["첟"]},{"id":"0ece90941e0c8568","term":"출근","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3","entryId":"72139","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"550a40b940e2e59e","term":"사회","zh":"社会","audio":"/audio/550a40b940e2e59e11c9.mp3","entryId":"62378","definition":"脱离学校、家庭，部队等被限制的或特殊集团的一般世界。","pronunciation":["사회","사훼"]},{"id":"b0f4a041f1780d8f","term":"첫발","zh":"第一步，起步，伊始","audio":"/audio/b0f4a041f1780d8f030b.mp3","entryId":"77620","definition":"开始做某事的最初。","pronunciation":["첟빨"]},{"id":"40bc7108e70fe665","term":"내딛다","zh":"步入","audio":"/audio/40bc7108e70fe665c9cd.mp3","entryId":"41863","definition":"第一次开始做某事或第一次涉足某个领域。","pronunciation":["내ː딛따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c9f76394df030025a41.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.585,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41863","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊。明天就是我第一次上班。我终于也要踏入社会了。","你和邻居平时有些来往吗？","你不是说找到工作了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对啊。明天就是我第一次上班。我终于也要踏入社会了。","你不是说找到工作了吗？","你和邻居平时有些来往吗？"],"answer":0}]}
